    "description": "Assorted Rough Gemstone Mineral Specimen Lot\nNatural Unpolished Stones\n20 Pieces Total\nThis collection features a diverse array of natural, rough gemstone and mineral specimens in their unpolished state. The lot includes a variety of geological materials, ranging from metallic pyrite clusters to crystalline clear quartz and vibrant blue sodalite. These pieces are ideal for lapidary work, crystal collections, or decorative displays, showcasing the raw beauty of natural mineral formations.\nIncludes approximately 20 distinct specimens of various colors and textures\nNotable stones include metallic pyrite, blue sodalite, green fluorite, and rose quartz\nClear quartz crystal points and banded jasper specimens present in the lot\nIndividual specimen sizes range from approximately 0.5 to 1.5 inches\nCondition:\nVery good natural condition. These are raw, unpolished specimens as shown in photographs. Surfaces exhibit natural textures, inclusions, and fractures inherent to rough minerals. No synthetic treatments or dyes are visually apparent across the lot. Pyrite pieces show characteristic metallic luster and crystal habit.\nState Tax:\nGoodwill Industries of the Southern Piedmont is required by law to collect state taxes.\nPayment Extensions -\nWe will no longer extend any payment deadlines.\nUpcycle Lots\n-\nEvery item we offer has its own characterlike happy little accidents that tell a story. You may find signs of wear such as small tears, fading, stains, or missing pieces. These details are part of what makes each piece special, like brushstrokes on a canvas.\nWe invite you to take a good look at the photos, which show the item's condition and charm. All items are sold just as they are, and because each one is unique, we aren't able to accept returns or offer refunds.\nThanks for bringing a little joy to something that's ready for a new chapter.\nITEMS ARE NOT OFFICIALLY APPRAISED, CERTIFIED OR AUTHENTICATED UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED. IF AN ITEM IS AUTHENTICATED, IT IS BY LEGITMARK AND WILL HAVE A COA QR CODE. SPORTS/ENTERTAINMENT MEMORABILIA IS AUTHENTICATED BY JSA AND WILL STATE IN THE LISTING.\nPlease use the Shipping Calculator on the listing page PRIOR to placing your bid.\nPLEASE SEE SELLER TAB FOR: REFUNDS/RETURNS.\nIMPORTANT NOTES: SEE SELLER TAB\nPLEASE SEE SHIPPING TAB FOR SHIPPING/PICKUP INFORMATION.\nDisclaimer:\nTitles, categories, and item specifics may be generated with the assistance of AI, and should be considered informational only. While efforts are made to ensure accuracy, errors may occur. Photos and written description should be relied upon when evaluating the item. Please ask any questions PRIOR to bidding, as ALL sales are FINAL unless the item is significantly not as described. Most Item(s) are pre-owned and may show normal signs of use, wear, storage, or handling. General polishing/cleaning is recommended before use. Items may have odors from previous ownership, storage environments, detergents, perfumes, smoke, or other scents. Jewelry item(s) are tested using a Thermo Scientific Niton DXL Precious Metal Analyzer. The Thermo Scientific Niton DXL desktop x-ray lab delivers fast and accurate XRF-based precious metal analysis. All gemstones are tested on a Presidium Duo Tester. This equipment CANNOT determine between natural, lab created & synthetic gemstones. We are not able to test any Pearls. We DO NOT open ANY watches. ALL items consist of used, donated items and have not been cleaned, serviced, or tested for full functionality unless otherwise stated. We DO NOT open or break down items, therefore unseen flaws or imperfections may not be shown or mentioned. Items are sold AS-IS, AS-FOUND, and may not be returned for any reason. We are NOT experts in any field. By bidding or purchasing, you acknowledge and accept these conditions.",
